<title>USA: Viacom's Blockbuster to buy Ireland chain.</title>
<headline>Viacom's Blockbuster to buy Ireland chain.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc's Blockbuster Entertainment Group said Tuesday it has agreed to buy Xtra-vision Group, a chain of video retail stores in Ireland.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the transaction, Blockbuster would have stores in nine European countries. The company has stores in 23 countries worldwide.</p>
</text>
